{
  "_": [
    "What each plate was captured at, per plate rather than per run.",
    "A board whose pictures are older than the app is worse than no board, and",
    "nothing else in this repo would ever notice: the plates are gitignored, no",
    "test asserts on them, and a caption written against code that has since",
    "moved still reads perfectly. This file is the only thing that can say so.",
    "",
    "Regenerate a source file's plates with `flutter test <source>`, stamp the",
    "ones it wrote with the commit they were rendered at, then",
    "`python tool/build_screen_board.py --stale` says which plates' descriptions",
    "(test/plates/board.captions.json) to re-read.",
    "",
    "The build 26 board (30 Sep) re-rendered every plate at one commit, so the",
    "shas match; they will not stay that way, which is the point of recording",
    "them per plate. hero_weights is a type study, not a screen, and was not",
    "retaken. Retired with the September board: settings-foot (T2), whose screen",
    "no longer exists.",
    "",
    "Build 27 UI fixes (30 Sep): every board plate re-rendered at 43a36eb, the",
    "commit after the fixes, and re-stamped. hero_weights again not retaken.",
    "Follow-ups (30 Sep): the plates they touch re-rendered at 46d0e80; the rest stay at 43a36eb.",
    "The build 27 candidate (1 Oct): every board plate re-rendered at db88a4f on develop, after Lift 2.0.0",
    "merged in beside Run. 80 of the 130 pictures were not on disk at all, so it was a full redraw.",
    "hero_weights again not retaken.",
    "Sign-in in two steps (1 Oct): every board plate re-rendered at 0945374, and account-gate-email",
    "added for the email form (K3). hero_weights again not retaken.",
    "Build 27 (1 Oct): every board plate re-rendered at 3ead35d, after the map cache and the bump to",
    "1.0.0+27. No picture changed. hero_weights again not retaken.",
    "1.0.1 so far (3 Oct): eleven plates retaken or new, B1 B8 B13 C14 K2 K3 L1 L2 L3 L7 P1,",
    "drawn at b0c650b with the shared sign-in head and the delete wording not yet committed,",
    "and stamped 8d77713, the commit that landed them. Every other plate is the 1 Oct picture,",
    "kept rather than redrawn on a Saturday, because the fixtures are dated from the day a plate",
    "is drawn. The plate harness now loads every image before it photographs, so B1, P1 and C14",
    "show the photographs the 1 Oct pictures had been taken too early to load.",
    "1.0.1, 5 Oct: twenty-one plates retaken or new (L1 to L8, Y1 to Y7, C3, C4, C10 to C12,",
    "and coach-signed-out with them), drawn at d81ca3e with the suite's coach sheet, paywall and",
    "delete screen not yet committed, and stamped 0ad435b, the commit that landed them. Y8 and Y9",
    "are not among them: their way in needs a planned run that Monday's fixtures lack.",
    "1.0.1, 5 Oct, evening: seventy-two plates retaken at 170ab2d on develop. The 45 that --stale flagged",
    "(account, arrival, coach, flows, screens and shell sources): 35 are pixel-identical to their 1 Oct",
    "pictures and the rest moved only by Monday's dates, so every description stands. With them, the",
    "morning's 21 and the six of 3 Oct, whose pictures were no longer on disk. The other 31 plates those",
    "files draw keep their 1 Oct pictures and stamps: a Monday redraw changes their weeks, not their code.",
    "H4, H5, Y8 and Y9 again not: Monday's fixtures have no planned run to reach them.",
    "1.0.1, 13 Oct (feat/run-race-finish): a race's finish. race-summary, race-plan-day, race-offer and race-sheet are new (F9 to F12); run-complete-record and run-recovered retaken for the records card and the splits; run-complete and run-from-log redrawn pixel-identical (their splits are below the fold) and re-stamped. All at 6822be6. run-start and run-count were redrawn by the same files and kept their 1 Oct pictures: only the day moved. The other 12 screens.dart plates redrew pixel-identical and are re-stamped at 6822be6 too. Plates --stale lists only for home_shell.dart were not redrawn: that commit changed the shell's summary and race wiring, which none of them draws.",
    "1.0.1, 13 Oct, later (feat/run-race-mode): run-start-race, 21-racing and 22-racing-small are new (R31 to R33). screens.dart and board.dart redrawn at 349810f: 22 pictures changed (01-early, 02-warming, 03-warmed, 04-deep, 06-lapped, 07-sheet-open, 09-unplanned-early, 10-unplanned-running, 15-small-early, 16-small-warmed, 17-max-early, 18-max-warmed, 19-easy-under, 20-easy-over, 21-threshold-under, 22-threshold-over, 24-peek, 27-discard, profile-records-by-hand, race-offer, race-plan-day, race-summary), 25 identical, all re-stamped. The board.dart recording plates had been the 1 Oct pictures; their maps sit a few points differently because the plate harness has loaded images before photographing since 8d77713, not because the screen changed. race-summary, race-plan-day and race-offer changed for the thinned kilometre pins; profile-records-by-hand for the line about races. journeys.dart redrawn at 349810f too: run-start and run-count changed for the Run or Race choice (R24, R25); run-recovered and its note identical. Plates --stale lists only for home_shell.dart or profile_screen.dart were not redrawn: the shell change is the race wiring, and the Profile change is a line shown only on S3.",
    "",
    "1.0.1 as released, 19 Oct (a Monday, at 4a03dc8 on develop; Run 1.0.1 went on sale on the App Store that day): every plate redrawn. 112 came out pixel-identical and are re-stamped. Taken new and re-stamped (their own code had moved): settings and settings-no-account (About gains Report a problem and Source code, the foot reads 1.0.1), home-with-plan, home-no-plan and home-first-launch (the treadmill row on the week tile; their 1 Oct pictures still had build 28's button under Start), and arrive-home, run-list and run-delete, whose only change was the dates. Restored to their earlier pictures and stamps, because only the day moved: add-run, coach-gate, coach-gate-after-consent, keep-runs-safe, paywall-store, plan-block, plan-calendar, plan-confirm, plan-near-race-confirm, run-count, run-edit, run-recovered, run-start, settings-backup, shell-plan, shell-plan-not-started. Kept on their 1 Oct pictures although --stale lists them, because a Monday cannot draw them: home-plan-not-started (a plan built today starts today), and the race plates shell-race-run-up, shell-race-day, shell-race-after, plan-race-week and week-race-week (the fixture's plan ends the Sunday before, so race week and race day come out wrong); last-run-subscribed, last-run-free, paywall-sign-in-first and paywall-restore-sign-in-first failed to draw (no planned run). Redraw those on another weekday.",
    "1.0.2 so far, 20 Oct (a Tuesday, on develop, not merged): the email path, address first (ADR-0047). arrival.dart redrawn at e5ee058, the commit that added its plates, and coach-signed-out with it. New and stamped there: arrive-email, arrive-email-typo, arrive-email-offline, arrive-email-password, arrive-email-wrong-password, arrive-email-apple, arrive-email-create, arrive-email-code and arrive-email-code-refused (B14 to B22); the two code plates are built with a clock that stands still. Pixel-identical and re-stamped: arrive-sign-in, account-gate and coach-signed-out (B8, K2, C14, whose code changed), the intro plates and the plan plates arrival.dart draws. Restored to their 19 Oct pictures and stamps, because only the day moved: arrive-home, keep-runs-safe, plan-confirm, plan-near-race-confirm and plan-reveal. arrive-sign-in-email and account-gate-email are gone with the form (B13 and K3 retired). Plates --stale lists only for home_shell.dart or auth_gate.dart were not redrawn: the shell change is a best-effort name copy and the sign-in it pushes, which none of them draws.",
    "1.0.2, 20 Oct, later: feat/email-first-sign-in merged in (9e91d15: confirm answers whether the password was replaced, and a cleared name stays cleared) and Run adapted at 08dd210. arrival.dart and coach-signed-out redrawn there: every plate stamped e5ee058 came out identical and is re-stamped 08dd210; the five that move with the day are again restored to 19 Oct.",
    "1.0.2 so far, 20 Oct, after the merge (2df7b7c): settings and settings-no-account retaken for the foot, which says 1.0.2 now that kAppVersion follows the pubspec; arrive-email-code retaken for the code field, which lost its 000000 hint. Every other plate account.dart, flows.dart and arrival.dart drew came out identical or moved only by the day, and keeps its picture and stamp. The 49 plates those three files drew identically are re-stamped at 2df7b7c, the commit they were drawn at.",
    "Tuesday 20 Oct, at 8f3b970 on develop: every plate redrawn, so the ones a Monday could not draw are drawn. Taken new: H1 to H6, Y8, Y9, E1, E2, E4, E6, and G4, G5, G6, K1, B7 (dates only, but --stale listed them). 126 came out identical and are re-stamped, E7 among them. Kept on their earlier pictures because only the day moved: add-run, coach-gate, coach-gate-after-consent, coach-report-sent, paywall-store, plan-calendar, run-delete, run-edit, run-list, run-recovered, settings-backup, shell-plan, shell-plan-not-started, shell-profile, shell-race-result-sheet.",
    "Friday 30 Oct, at b7d5d49 on develop (Run 1.0.2 submitted on 29 Oct as build 32; develop is 1.0.3): every plate redrawn. Taken new: settings and settings-no-account (the foot says 1.0.3, as develop's pubspec does), legal-privacy (the policy says what email-first sign-in and Google's profile pass on) and coach-consent-refused (C15, new: the coach's server finding no permission). 123 came out identical and are re-stamped. Restored to their earlier pictures and stamps, because only the day or the hour moved: add-run, arrive-home, coach-gate, coach-gate-after-consent, coach-report-sent, home-first-launch, home-no-plan, home-plan-not-started, home-with-plan, keep-runs-safe, last-run-free, last-run-subscribed, paywall-store, plan-calendar, plan-confirm, plan-near-race-confirm, plan-race-week, plan-reveal, run-count, run-delete, run-edit, run-list, run-recovered, run-start, settings-backup, shell-plan, shell-plan-not-started, shell-race-after, shell-race-day, shell-race-result-sheet, shell-race-run-up.",
    "Friday 30 Oct, at 9bcb426 on develop (Run 1.1.0+33; the tour after the coach's intro, ADR-0050): arrival, shell, account, flows and screens redrawn. New: tour-today, tour-week, tour-plan, tour-profile, tour-settings, tour-coach and tour-start (B23 to B29, walked from the welcome) and tour-replay-settings (T20, Settings' Show me around played signed in). Taken new: arrive-home (reached by the tour's Done now), settings and settings-no-account (Show me around under About; the foot says 1.1.0). 75 came out identical and are re-stamped. The same five files were also drawn the same day from the code before the tour (092b817's lib): every plate but those three matched, so the tour's wrappers change no other screen. Kept on their earlier pictures and stamps, because only the day or the hour moved: add-run, coach-gate, home-first-launch, home-no-plan, home-plan-not-started, home-with-plan, keep-runs-safe, last-run-free, last-run-subscribed, paywall-store, plan-calendar, plan-confirm, plan-near-race-confirm, plan-race-week, plan-reveal, run-delete, run-edit, run-list, settings-backup, shell-plan-not-started, shell-plan, shell-race-after, shell-race-day, shell-race-result-sheet, shell-race-run-up.",
